The account needs a simple thread-safe state model:



- Track whether the account is open.

- Track the current balance.

- Make all account operations synchronized so concurrent threads cannot race while reading/updating state.

- Fail operations on a closed account.

- Prevent negative deposits/withdrawals and withdrawals larger than the balance.



