Implementation details:
```
class GoCounting {
  private final char[][] board;
  private final int rows;
  private final int cols;

  GoCounting(String board) {
    if (board == null || board.isEmpty()) { rows=0; cols=0; this.board=new char[0][0]; return; }
    String[] lines = board.split("\n", -1);
    // remove \r
    for i lines[i] = lines[i].endsWith("\r") ? lines[i].substring(0,len-1) : lines[i];
    rows=lines.length;
    cols=0; for line: cols=Math.max(cols,line.length());
    this.board=new char[rows][cols];
    for r: for c: if c<line.length() board[r][c]=line.charAt(c); else board[r][c]=' ';
  }
```
