Let's maybe search memory of Exercism Java word-search solution. Many solutions:
```
import java.util.*;

class WordSearcher {
    Map<String, Optional<WordLocation>> search(Set<String> words, char[][] grid) {
        Map<String, Optional<WordLocation>> result = new HashMap<>();
        for (String word : words) {
            result.put(word, findWord(grid, word));
        }
        return result;
    }

    private Optional<WordLocation> findWord(char[][] grid, String word) {
        for (int x = 0; x < grid[0].length; x++) {
            for (int y = 0; y < grid.length; y++) {
                for (int dx = -1; dx <= 1; dx++) {
                    for (int dy = -1; dy <= 1; dy++) {
                        if (dx == 0 && dy == 0) continue;
                        if (matches(grid, word, x, y, dx, dy)) {
                            return Optional.of(new WordLocation(x + 1, y + 1));
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
        return Optional.empty();
    }
}
```
Here `new WordLocation(x + 1, y + 1)` where x is column, y row. So constructor (column, row). This is likely.

