Let's search memory of Exercism Java word-search reference solution. I vaguely recall:
```
class WordSearcher {
    Map<String, Optional<WordLocation>> search(Set<String> words, char[][] grid) {
        Map<String, Optional<WordLocation>> result = new HashMap<>();
        for (String word : words) {
            result.put(word, findWord(grid, word));
        }
        return result;
    }

    private Optional<WordLocation> findWord(char[][] grid, String word) {
        for (int row = 0; row < grid.length; row++) {
            for (int col = 0; col < grid[row].length; col++) {
                for (int dRow = -1; dRow <= 1; dRow++) {
                    for (int dCol = -1; dCol <= 1; dCol++) {
                        if (dRow == 0 && dCol == 0) continue;
                        if (matches(grid, word, row, col, dRow, dCol)) {
                            return Optional.of(new WordLocation(col + 1, row + 1, col + word.length(), row + ...));
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
        return Optional.empty();
    }
}
```
